  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Social,GFX Online 社交能力包:好友/群组/聊天/通知/处罚/举报裁决六域 + 聊天审计投影(InMemory 默认存储,描述符服务面 Override 替换)+ admin handlers(kick/revoke/mute/查询族). Social capability package for the GFX Online family: friends, groups, chat, notifications, punishments and report adjudication plus the chat-audit projection with in-memory default stores and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
